Hello CIP Core WG members,

I'd like to share the package proposal for Debian 11 bullseye.
This is the initial proposal for bullseye, which just includes the packages
installed by debootstrap minbase.
This intends to add the minimum package set of bullseye to the scope of
CIP Core's long term maintenance.

Let's check and review the contents in the next CIP Core WG meeting.

Best regards,
Kazu

